    "q-94484": {
      "dom_id": "step-q94484",
      "name": "Question 8",
      "problem": "What is the trace in the $xz$-plane of the elliptic cone ${x}^{2}+4{y}^{2}=4{z}^{2}\\,?$",
      "worked_solution": "To find the trace in the $xz$-plane, we substitute $y=0$ into the equation of the elliptic cone, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+4(0)^{2} & =4{z}^{2} \\\\ {x}^{2} & =4{z}^{2} \\\\ \\pm x & =2z \\\\ z & =\\pm \\frac{x}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives us two lines in the $xz$-plane with equations $z=\\pm \\frac{x}{2}.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
